---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {
  localizedPath,
  companyName,
  translator,
  type Locale,
} from '../../data/i18n';
import { copy, type ProductData } from '../../data/products';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
  product: ProductData;
}
const { locale, product: p } = Astro.props;
const c = (value: readonly [string, string]) => copy(value, locale);
const t = translator(locale);
const path = `/products/${p.slug}`;
---

<Layout
  locale={locale}
  title={`${p.name} ${c(['Privacy Policy', '隐私政策'])} | Hailink Labs`}
  description={c([
    `How ${p.name} handles local records, files, backups and support correspondence.`,
    `${p.name} 隐私政策：了解本地记录、文件、备份及支持邮件的处理方式。`,
  ])}
>
  <section class="page-intro policy-intro">
    <a class="breadcrumb" href={localizedPath(path, locale)}>
      {p.name} <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
    </a>
    <p class="eyebrow" lang="en">
      {p.storeName}
    </p>
    <h1>{c(['Privacy policy', '隐私政策'])}</h1>
    <p class="intro-copy">
      {c(['Effective September 17, 2026', '生效日期：2026 年 9 月 17 日'])}
    </p>
  </section>
  <article class="policy prose">
    {locale === 'zh-CN' && (
      <aside class="review-notice">
        本中文版本为方便阅读提供。如有差异，以
        <a href={`${path}/privacy`} lang="en" hreflang="en">
          英文版本
        </a>
        为准。
      </aside>
    )}
    <h2>{c(['Who we are', '我们是谁'])}</h2>
    <p>
      {p.name}
      {c([
        ' is developed by Hailink Labs, the brand of ',
        ' 由 Hailink Labs 开发，品牌所属法律主体为',
      ])}
      {companyName(locale)}
      {c([
        '. This policy covers the app and your contact with us.',
        '。本政策适用于 App 及你与我们的联系。',
      ])}
    </p>
    <h2>{c(['Information used by the app', 'App 使用的信息'])}</h2>
    {p.privacy.map((text) => (
      <p>{c(text)}</p>
    ))}
    <h2>{c(['Local storage and cloud services', '本地存储与云服务'])}</h2>
    <p>{c(p.storage)}</p>
    <p>
      {c([
        'Hailink Labs does not automatically receive your app records or operate a server for them. Your iPhone’s operating-system backup may include app data according to your Apple settings. Saving an export to iCloud Drive is a file destination you choose, not automatic app synchronization.',
        'Hailink Labs 不会自动接收你的 App 记录，也不为这些记录运营服务器。iPhone 操作系统备份可能根据 Apple 设置包含 App 数据。将导出文件保存到 iCloud Drive 是你选择的文件保存方式，不是 App 自动同步。',
      ])}
    </p>
    <h2>{c(['Photos, signatures and permissions', '照片、签名与权限'])}</h2>
    {p.media.map((text) => (
      <p>{c(text)}</p>
    ))}
    <h2>{c(['Exports and backups', '导出与备份'])}</h2>
    <p>{c(p.export)}</p>
    <p>
      {c([
        'Exports and full backups may contain the information you entered and any supported attachments. The app does not encrypt exported backups. Choose a trusted destination and protect the files. Other apps, cloud providers or recipients handle shared copies under their own practices.',
        '导出文件和完整备份可能包含你录入的信息及支持的附件。App 不对导出的备份加密。请选择可信位置并妥善保管文件。其他 App、云服务商或接收方按各自的规则处理分享副本。',
      ])}
    </p>
    <h2>{c(['Purchases', '购买'])}</h2>
    {p.slug === 'tmproof' ? (
      <p>
        {c([
          'TMProof does not use in-app purchase processing or store purchase entitlements. Hailink Labs does not receive payment card details through the app.',
          'TMProof 不使用 App 内购买处理，也不保存购买权益。Hailink Labs 不会通过 App 接收支付卡信息。',
        ])}
      </p>
    ) : (
      <p>
        {c([
          'Apple processes purchases and restores through the App Store and StoreKit. The app uses verified transaction information to determine seven-day trial and lifetime access, and caches access information locally for offline use. Purchase access is separate from record backups. Hailink Labs does not receive your payment card details or operate a purchase receipt server.',
          'Apple 通过 App Store 与 StoreKit 处理购买和恢复。App 使用已验证交易信息判断七天试用与终身权益，并在本地缓存权益以供离线使用。购买权益与记录备份分开处理。Hailink Labs 不接收支付卡信息，也不运营购买收据服务器。',
        ])}
      </p>
    )}
    <p>
      {c(['Apple handles its services under its own ', 'Apple 按其自身的'])}
      <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/">
        {c(['privacy policy', '隐私政策'])}
      </a>
      {c([' and device settings.', '及设备设置处理相关服务。'])}
    </p>
    <h2>{c(['Analytics and tracking', '分析与跟踪'])}</h2>
    <p>
      {c([
        'The app has no advertising, analytics or third-party crash reporting SDK and does not track your behavior across other companies’ apps or websites. Apple may separately process usage or diagnostic information under your device settings and its own policies.',
        'App 没有广告、分析或第三方崩溃报告 SDK，不跟踪你在其他公司 App 或网站中的行为。Apple 可能依据设备设置及其自身政策单独处理使用或诊断信息。',
      ])}
    </p>
    <h2>{c(['Support correspondence', '支持邮件'])}</h2>
    <p>
      {t(
        'If you email us, we receive your email address, message, and any attachments you send. We use these to answer you and resolve the issue. Our company mailbox uses Tencent’s business email service to deliver and store correspondence. Support messages may be accessed by Hailink Labs in China.',
      )}
    </p>
    <p>
      {t(
        'Please avoid sending sensitive customer information, passwords, payment credentials, or full business backups. We do not sell support information or use it for advertising. We keep support correspondence for no longer than 12 months after an issue is closed, unless an ongoing issue or legal obligation requires longer retention.',
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{c(['Retention and your choices', '保存期限与你的选择'])}</h2>
    <p>
      {c([
        'Your app records remain in local storage until you delete them or remove the app. Deletion does not remove earlier exports, device backups or files shared with other people. Manage those copies separately. Keep a full backup before uninstalling the app or replacing your device. We cannot retrieve local records from a Hailink Labs server or erase copies held by your chosen recipients.',
        'App 记录保存在本地，直到你删除记录或移除 App。删除不会移除之前的导出文件、设备备份或分享给他人的文件，这些副本需要单独管理。卸载 App 或换机前请保留完整备份。我们无法从 Hailink Labs 服务器找回本地记录，也不能代你删除由所选接收方持有的副本。',
      ])}
    </p>
    <p>
      {t(
        'You may contact us to request access, correction, or deletion of personal information held in our support correspondence, or to ask how it is used. Depending on where you live, you may have additional privacy rights. We may need to verify a request using the relevant email address before acting on it.',
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{c(['Website visits', '网站访问'])}</h2>
    <p>
      {t(
        'This website has no advertising trackers, analytics scripts, contact forms, or account system. GitHub Pages provides hosting and delivery; GitHub processes technical request information such as IP addresses to deliver and protect the site. See',
      )}{' '}
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
        {t('GitHub’s privacy statement')}
      </a>
      {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '。' : '.'}
    </p>
    <h2>{c(['Policy changes', '政策变更'])}</h2>
    <p>
      {c([
        'We will update this page and its effective date if data handling changes. Material changes will be explained here and, where appropriate, in the app.',
        '数据处理方式变化时，我们会更新本页及生效日期。重大变化将在这里说明，并在适当情况下通过 App 告知。',
      ])}
    </p>
    <h2>{c(['Contact', '联系'])}</h2>
    <p>
      Hailink Labs
      <br />
      {companyName(locale)}
      <br />
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=${p.name}%20Privacy`}>
        {site.email}
      </a>
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href={localizedPath(`${path}/support`, locale)}>
        {c(['Product support', '产品支持'])}
      </a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
